        children: "public Set<NodeId> reachableFrom(\n    NodeId start,\n    Map<NodeId, List<NodeId>> graph\n) {\n    Set<NodeId> visited = new HashSet<>();\n    Queue<NodeId> queue = new ArrayDeque<>();\n\n    visited.add(start);\n    queue.offer(start);\n\n    while (!queue.isEmpty()) {\n        NodeId current = queue.poll();\n\n        for (NodeId next : graph.getOrDefault(current, List.of())) {\n            if (visited.add(next)) {\n                queue.offer(next);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    return visited;\n}\n"
