        children: "HttpClient\n- Reusable, immutable client.\n- Create once per config/downstream.\n- Set connect timeout.\n- Configure redirect/proxy/auth/SSL as needed.\n\nHttpRequest\n- Immutable request.\n- Built with builder.\n- Set URI, method, headers, timeout, body.\n\nBodyPublisher\n- Sends request body.\n- ofString for JSON/text.\n- ofFile for file upload.\n- ofByteArray for binary.\n\nHttpResponse\n- Has statusCode, headers, body.\n- Body type depends on BodyHandler.\n\nBodyHandler\n- ofString for small text.\n- ofByteArray for small binary.\n- ofFile for download.\n- ofInputStream for streaming.\n- discarding for no body.\n\nSync\n- client.send()\n- simple and readable.\n- good with virtual threads.\n\nAsync\n- client.sendAsync()\n- returns CompletableFuture.\n- good for fan-out/fan-in.\n\nProduction Rules\n- Reuse client.\n- Timeout every request.\n- Encode query params.\n- Handle status codes explicitly.\n- Retry only safe/idempotent operations.\n- Limit concurrency.\n- Mask secrets.\n- Close streaming bodies.\n"
